# APP_URL: The URL where this applet is hosted.
# AI Studio automatically injects this at runtime with the Cloud Run service URL.
APP_URL="MY_APP_URL"

# ADMIN_API_KEY: Required to call the content-management endpoints
# (POST/PUT /api/listings, POST /api/tiktok, POST /api/upload-image).
# Without this set, those endpoints are disabled entirely - the site still
# works fine using the photos and text committed in /public and src/data.
# Set a long random value here and pass it as an "x-admin-key" header
# when you want to update content via the API instead of editing files directly.
ADMIN_API_KEY=""

# INQUIRY_WEBHOOK_URL: Optional. If set, every new contact-form submission is
# POSTed here as JSON, in addition to being saved to user_data/inquiries.json.
# Paste a Slack "Incoming Webhook" URL, a Zapier "Catch Hook" URL (you're
# already using Zapier for the chat widget), or any endpoint that accepts a
# JSON POST, and you'll get notified the moment a lead comes in instead of
# only finding it if you happen to check the server.
INQUIRY_WEBHOOK_URL=""
